  "title": "learnwithmrcedric: names and passwords",
  "notes": [
    "Students sign in with their name and a password (Science or Computing, chosen on the card). Old 4-number PINs still work once, then the page asks for a proper password",
    "The Teacher Hub signs in with a username and password. The first time, the Hub asks for your teacher PIN to set them. Change them in the T menu, Username and password",
    "The portal: a roomier card, a small teacher link, and stars and galaxies bent by the black hole's gravity behind NASA's simulation",
    "The decks' own sign-in box takes a password",
    "Includes release 29 (Streak Challenge). Paste: App.gs, Code.gs, Hub.gs and ComputingCode.gs, then deploy a new version. The pages update themselves"
  ],
